failure.message:
Unresolved compilation problems: 
	Type mismatch: cannot convert from ChromeDriver to ThreadLocal&lt;WebDriver&gt;
	The constructor WebDriverWait(ThreadLocal&lt;WebDriver&gt;, Duration) is undefined
	Type mismatch: cannot convert from WebDriverWait to ThreadLocal&lt;WebDriverWait&gt;
	The method manage() is undefined for the type ThreadLocal&lt;WebDriver&gt;
	The method get(Thread) in the type ThreadLocal&lt;WebDriver&gt; is not applicable for the arguments (String)
